118 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 70 0 R
/E (Finfolio 2.0 accepts portfolios that can contain Vietnamese equities and internationally traded commodity proxies. This scope creates a data problem before it creates a calculation problem. Instruments use different symbol conventions, prices are quoted in different currencies, and markets do not share identical holidays or closing times. A portfolio, benchmark and exchange-rate series can each look valid while remaining incompatible for a relative performance calculation. The project needed a documented contract connecting user input to provider observations and stating when a calculation may proceed.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
